                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">越地春风</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">育英才，校园</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">灯火照师心</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。在</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">第42个教师节</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">到来之际，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">9月10日</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">下午</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，绍兴一中教育集团领导班子、全体教职工</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">和部分学生代表</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">齐聚</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">镜湖校区</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">养新书藏图书馆报告厅，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">举行</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">庆祝第42个教师节暨越民奖学金颁奖</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">大会，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">共同庆祝</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">属于自己的节日</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">活动特邀</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1975届校友、绍兴一中校友会会长、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">知名</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">爱心人士、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我校</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">越民奖学金设立者王卫列先生，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">到会颁奖</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">大会开场，全体与会人员共同观看了习近平总书记教师节问候视频。殷殷嘱托、深切关怀，让在场教师倍感温暖、备受鼓舞。随后，“循光而行，不负师恩”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">——</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">团委、学生会带来</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学生歌曲串烧</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，为庆祝活动点亮温情开场</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。青春的歌声里，有对老师的深情告白，也有对一中岁月的温暖回望。舞台上下，师恩与青春交汇，为整场大会铺开温情底色。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>先进表彰：</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>致敬每一份耕耘</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校对过去一</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">年在教育教学、班级建设、教育科研、管理服务等工作中涌现出的先进集体和个人进行了隆重表彰。从“三名奖励”资深班主任，到学科综合素养比武获奖教师；从市直、市级各类先进，到三十年教龄教师，一批批优秀教师以坚守与钻研诠释着师者担当。大会同时向默默保障校园运行的总务后勤优秀员工致以敬意，感谢他们以日复一日的付出托举学校发展。越民奖学金系列奖项则既表彰了在全国高中生物学联赛中摘得一等奖的优秀学子，也致敬了</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">育人楷模</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">奖”“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高考突出贡献</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">奖”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">和退休教师“孺子牛</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">奖</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">等获奖教师</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，让奖教奖学、尊师重教的情怀在校园里交相辉映。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">每一份荣誉背后，都是平凡日子的沉淀；每一次掌声响起，都是对“师者”的真挚礼赞。在此，向所有受到表彰的教职工和集体表示热烈祝贺，向坚守在教学、德育、管理、服务</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">保障</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">等岗位上的全体教职工致以衷心感谢和崇高敬意。是你们以三尺讲台的坚守、日复一日的陪伴、幕后无声的保障，托举起学生的成长与学校的发展。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>代表发言：传承教书育人</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>的</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>初心使命</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">获奖教师代表王晶晶老师</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">发表感言</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">她</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">以“我是绍兴一中的学生、老师、家长”三重身份，讲述</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">着她</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">与一中</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一辈子的缘分</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。二十五年站讲台，于她都是梦想成真的快乐。她表示</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">自己</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">特意穿上</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">了</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">今年送考</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">时</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">穿</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">这件旗袍，祝愿每一位一中人日日好事发生，祝愿绍兴一中岁岁好事连连。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">颁奖嘉宾王卫列先生</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在致辞中</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">深情回忆起父亲</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">中学</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">任教的日子，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">回忆起自己在一中求学的日子，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">表示一中师者的精神在家风与校风间传承，历久弥新。他向所有辛勤付出的老师致以敬意和感谢，感谢老师们把青春、智慧与热爱留在三尺讲台，托举一届又一届</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一中</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学子成长</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">成才</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>新教师宣誓：接好</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>为国育才</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>的接力棒</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">新教师代表喻屿发言。她说，从前的9月10日，于自己而言始终是讲台下的一份仰望；今天，第一次以教师身份站在节日的另一端，才真正掂出“谢谢”二字的分量。她代表全体新教师向各位前辈道一声感谢，表示将全力以赴，接好教书育人的接力棒。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">随后，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">大会</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">举行新教师宣誓仪式</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">新教师代表</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">陶中天的领誓下，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全体</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">新教师对教育事业作</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">出</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">郑重承诺</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。会场上，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">铮铮誓言</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">久久回响，映衬出</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">育人生力军</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">师者风采</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>领导</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>寄语</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>：归零再出发，兼容并包向未来</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校党委书记丁初效作</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">总结</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">讲话。他代表学校党委向全体教职工致以节日问候，向受到表彰的老师们表示热烈祝贺，对大家在学科教学、班级建设、教育科研、管理服务和后勤保障中取得的优异成绩表示衷心感谢。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">他强调，面对新学年</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、新征程</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">要带着“归零”的清醒再出发、保持“空杯”的心态再奋斗；同时指出学校仍处于集团融合期、改革攻坚期、发展跃升期，需在融合中取长补短、互惠共赢，推动“态势”成“定势”、“优势”成“胜势”。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">他指出，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校根基在教师、希望在教师</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教师要有情怀，老教师要传经验、带</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">新人</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、作表率，骨干教师要勇担当、善钻研、立标杆，年轻教师要沉下心、练硬功、强本领，从适教愿教到能教会教再到爱教乐教。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全体一中人</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">要践行“兼容并包”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的校史文化精神</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，做到赏人长处、容人短处、帮人难处、记人好处。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">他</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">希望</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全体一中人</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">要</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">坚守教育初心、精进专业学养、践行育人使命，培养更多“抱定宗旨、砥砺德行、博雅通达”的一中学子</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，在新征程上以更多更好的新成绩再立新功</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">第42个教师节</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我们致敬讲台上的坚守</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">也致敬幕后的付出</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">致敬一代代一中人的传承</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">也致敬正在接棒的新生力量</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">愿每一位老师</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">眼里有光，心中有爱，脚下有路</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">愿绍兴一中</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在新学年归零再出发</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在兼容并包中成就彼此</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在130周年校庆的新节点上续写荣光</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>附</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>先进表彰</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>名单</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（1）“三名奖励”资深班主任名单</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（唐海燕、陈雪萍、蔡红、陈丹燕、朱时妙、施笑程、叶望尧、丁素琴、杨国仁、刘晓牛、孔祥新）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（2）2026年教师学科综合素养比武优秀名单</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">①市直级获奖</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">40周岁及以上，排名前10%：许敏、骆永明、丁金美、钱虹燕、叶建映、王晶晶、彭爱波、邢婷</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">40周岁及以上，排名前10%到20%：戴华敏、张洁慧、陈美琴、俞晓清、沈剑蕾、黎小琴、张伟丰、张叶、俞宝根</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">40周岁及以下，排名前10%：沈栋啸、王一行、陈华、傅红霞、王芳芳、闫彦彦、王绍虞、祝智浩、周冰、沈洋铭、冯莹、刘军霞、白宗刚、翁天东、陈微微</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">40周岁及以下，排名前10%到20%：陈忆宁、金杰、俞一凡、潘贤哲、马红蕾、王维、任宇颖、孙舒曼、张超、陈浩、陈依、余凡</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">②市级获奖</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一等奖：王一行、陈华、骆永明、金杰、王芳芳、彭爱波、张伟丰、祝智浩、沈洋铭、周冰、白宗刚、陈微微</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">二等奖：翁鹏飞、俞宝根、孟玲燕、余凡</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）2025学年市直先进颁奖</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">①市直优秀党员</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（孙舒曼、顾秀芳、王一行、陈忆宁）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">②市直优秀党务工作者</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（金笛、徐萍）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">③市直德育优秀工作者</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（黄亚萍、彭爱波、茹奕蓓、刘晓牛）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">④市直优秀班集体</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高三（05）班（王晶晶）、高三（06）班（沈栋啸）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高三（14）班（骆永明）、高二（02）班（徐冲越）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高一（14）班（俞晓清）、龙山高二（02）班（陈雪萍）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）2025学年市级先进颁奖</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">①市级班主任基本功比武一等奖</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（王一行）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">②市级德育先进班集体</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（王晶晶）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）三十年教龄教师颁奖</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（许琪玫）</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">6</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">）2025学年绍兴一中越民奖学金颁奖</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">①育人楷模奖</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-to